{"version":1,"content":"<p>法國首都巴黎等城市上周末爆發示威騷亂，導致當局要實施宵禁後【相關報道】，預料周六（24日）會出現新一輪示威。</p><p>在巴黎著名地標香榭麗舍大道，有商戶在大門、櫥窗加裝木板或鐵閘，避免遭受搶掠。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T05:41:24.667448+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":93,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T05:25:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T09:18:12.281795+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T05:38:09.352710+00:00","content_hash":"9210bfbfe1049e2b434d20dbdca541c2fd5a503894808d88757bfe055c9bad6f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}